@startuml
title C4 — System Context: Booking platform

!define DEVICONS https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tupadr3/plantuml-icon-font-sprites/master/devicons
!define ICONURL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tupadr3/plantuml-icon-font-sprites/master/icons

actor "Customer" as cust
actor "Hotel Manager" as host
actor "Support Agent" as agent

rectangle "Booking Platform" as platform {
    component "Web App"      as web
    component "Mobile App"   as mob
    component "Backoffice"   as back
    component "Booking API"  as api
    database  "Bookings DB"  as db
}

rectangle "External" {
    component "Payment Gateway" as psp
    component "Email Service"   as mail
    component "Map Provider"    as maps
    component "Identity Provider" as idp
}

cust  --> web  : search & book
cust  --> mob  : search & book
host  --> back : manage rooms
agent --> back : assist customers

web  --> api
mob  --> api
back --> api
api  --> db
api  --> psp  : charge / refund
api  --> mail : confirmations
api  --> maps : geocoding
api  --> idp  : SSO

note bottom
  Ownership boundary: the platform
  controls everything in the inner
  rectangle. External services are
  reached via documented contracts.
end note

@enduml
